# Allowlist: only source code enters the backend / model build context.
# Data (processed/), checkpoints and results (results/, pretrained_weights/), demo outputs
# (demo_artifacts/), environments, reports and runtime files are never sent to the Docker daemon;
# the model service reads data and checkpoints through read-only bind mounts instead.
*
!src/
!scripts/
!demo/
!services/
!docker/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pth
**/*.parquet
**/*.csv
